          "date": "2026-11-08 02:59:17.000000000",
          "tz": -360
        },
        "subject": "LU-20860 doc: agent guidance review follow-ups",
        "message": "LU-20860 doc: agent guidance review follow-ups\n\nAddress review comments on the agent workflow guidance: only update an\nexisting man page's .TH date when it is old, add man4 pages only for\nparameters that exist, test PAGE_SIZE and data path patches on a\nlarge-page node, describe the problem in the past tense, retest only\nenforced sessions, check older patchsets for comments before pushing,\nuse trivial with a testlist for userspace-only patches, and note how\ntestgroup= combines with testlist=.  Fix several small wording issues.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5\nChange-Id: I83c4656d7663380a5bc8a1a7380f2f06113ebbe5\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
